//@version=6
strategy("W5 C2 POOC long opening call (comm 0.05 slip 1)", overlay=true, process_orders_on_close=true, commission_type=strategy.commission.percent, commission_value=0.05, slippage=1)

// Lane W5-ENG-MARGIN-V6, mechanism C2 (the long opening call). A 100%-of-equity
// LONG process_orders_on_close fills one tick over a signal close, and the
// entry's commission leaves it short of margin. The next bar opens one tick
// above that close, at it, or one tick below (the cells of w5-m2-pooc-short-open).
// Does TradingView call at the fill, or at the next open, and at which price
// does it size the call there -- the signal close or the open?
if time == timestamp("UTC", 2025, 4, 2, 0, 0)
    strategy.entry("L", strategy.long, comment="long")
if time == timestamp("UTC", 2025, 4, 2, 0, 0) + 30 * 60000
    strategy.close_all(comment="cleanup")
if time == timestamp("UTC", 2025, 4, 2, 3, 0)
    strategy.entry("L", strategy.long, comment="long")
if time == timestamp("UTC", 2025, 4, 2, 3, 0) + 30 * 60000
